1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,972
‎Nikmati rasa dingin itu!

2
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,682
‎Beginilah rasanya musim luruh.

3
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,978
‎Saya suka detik begini.
‎Kita merasai suasana musim.

4
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,938
‎Awak selalu cakap begitu.

5
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:25,191
{\an8}‎Saya suka acara musim panas
‎dengan suasana musim panasnya

6
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:28,319
{\an8}‎dan saya suka sensasi dingin
‎yang masih terasa lembap

7
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,072
{\an8}‎apabila kita bersiar-siar
‎waktu malam ketika musim panas…

8
00:00:31,781 --> 00:00:33,033
‎Tapi detik seperti ini,

9
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:36,202
‎apabila cuaca sejuk
‎dan kita rasa perubahan musim,

10
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:39,039
‎inilah detik yang buat
‎saya rasa sangat teruja.

11
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:41,207
{\an8}‎Rasanya saya faham.

12
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:44,127
‎Macam selepas menjalani
‎rutin musim panas yang panjang

13
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,005
‎dan kita rasa,
‎"Wah, saya dah semakin kuat?"

14
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:51,217
‎Mungkin perasaan itu masih bermain
‎dalam fikiran saya. Awak rasa begitu?

15
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:53,595
‎Saya tarik balik. Saya tak faham langsung.

16
00:00:53,678 --> 00:00:54,929
‎Kenapa pula?

17
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,021
‎Musim luruh.

18
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:05,940
‎Bila hari jadi awak, Amamiya?

19
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:08,485
‎Awak nak buat sesuatu untuk saya?

20
00:01:08,568 --> 00:01:10,820
‎Tak, jangan harapkan
‎sesuatu yang istimewa…

21
00:01:11,529 --> 00:01:13,114
{\an8}<i>‎Pada 29 September.</i>

22
00:01:14,199 --> 00:01:15,200
{\an8}<i>‎Tak lama lagi.</i>

23
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:18,119
<i>‎Hari jadinya dah tak lama.</i>

24
00:01:18,203 --> 00:01:19,204
<i>‎Tapi…</i>

25
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:20,789
‎Baiklah.

26
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,708
{\an8}‎Saya akan jauhkan diri daripada Amamiya.

27
00:01:24,584 --> 00:01:27,462
<i>‎Beria-ia betul aku cakap begitu, tapi…</i>

28
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:30,924
<i>‎Sejauh mana aku perlu jauhkan diri.</i>

29
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:33,176
<i>‎Kami tak pernah menetapkan batas itu.</i>

30
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:35,970
<i>‎Boleh beri dia hadiah hari jadi?
‎Tak, itu melampaui batas.</i>

31
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:37,055
<i>‎Selamat hari jadi!</i>

32
00:01:37,889 --> 00:01:40,225
<i>‎Kalau dengan cara yang tak serius?</i>

33
00:01:40,308 --> 00:01:44,479
<i>‎Tapi kalau boleh,
‎aku nak balas pemberian dia.</i>

34
00:01:45,855 --> 00:01:50,735
<i>‎Dia tak hadir ke sekolah hujung minggu,
‎jadi aku agak risaukan dia.</i>

35
00:01:51,361 --> 00:01:53,613
<i>‎Aku nak tanya jika dia okey,</i>

36
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:57,075
<i>‎tapi aku tak layak buat begitu.</i>

37
00:02:01,329 --> 00:02:02,330
‎GRED 2 KELAS 2

38
00:02:02,413 --> 00:02:03,706
‎Apa? Seriuslah?

39
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:07,001
‎Awak berpisah dengan Kuriki?

40
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:43,932
‎EPISOD 22
‎TITIK PERUBAHAN

41
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,143
‎BEBERAPA HARI SEBELUMNYA
‎AMAMIYA

42
00:03:47,769 --> 00:03:49,395
<i>‎Awak okey?</i>

43
00:03:51,731 --> 00:03:54,150
<i>‎Terima kasih. Saya dah okey.</i>

44
00:03:58,238 --> 00:04:00,323
‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎SAYA NAK BINCANG SESUATU

45
00:04:00,406 --> 00:04:01,658
<i>‎Sampai sekarang…</i>

46
00:04:02,617 --> 00:04:03,660
‎Saya nak berpisah.

47
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:05,912
‎Okey.

48
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:11,793
{\an8}<i>‎Selama ini aku ikut saja apa mereka mahu
‎kerana aku fikir itu yang terbaik.</i>

49
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:15,213
<i>‎Lebih mudah apabila
‎orang lain yang buat keputusan.</i>

50
00:04:16,381 --> 00:04:19,008
<i>‎Kalau bukan aku yang buat pilihan,</i>

51
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:20,969
<i>‎maka ia bukan kegagalan aku.</i>

52
00:04:21,761 --> 00:04:23,179
<i>‎Aku pihak yang ditinggalkan,</i>

53
00:04:23,846 --> 00:04:25,640
<i>‎jadi bukan aku yang melukakan hati.</i>

54
00:04:26,516 --> 00:04:28,559
<i>‎Asalkan aku penuhi jangkaan mereka,</i>

55
00:04:29,143 --> 00:04:31,688
<i>‎aku bukan pesalah
‎dan aku bukan orang jahat.</i>

56
00:04:32,355 --> 00:04:35,817
<i>‎Aku buat begini
‎sebab tak nak bertanggungjawab.</i>

57
00:04:36,901 --> 00:04:39,070
{\an8}‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎SAYA NAK BINCANG SESUATU

58
00:04:39,779 --> 00:04:44,367
<i>‎Siapa sangka memulakan perpisahan
‎terasa begitu berat?</i>

59
00:04:45,618 --> 00:04:47,912
‎Awak baru ditinggalkan,
‎tapi awak selamba saja.

60
00:04:48,454 --> 00:04:50,373
‎Biadab. Saya terluka juga.

61
00:04:50,456 --> 00:04:51,666
‎AKU SEBELUM INI…

62
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:56,921
<i>‎Aku terlalu sibuk
‎memahami keadaan sekeliling</i>

63
00:04:57,005 --> 00:05:00,550
<i>‎dan buat sesuatu
‎yang aku rasa semua orang harapkan.</i>

64
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:03,553
<i>‎Aku suka menyibuk
‎demi kepuasan diri sendiri,</i>

65
00:05:03,636 --> 00:05:06,389
<i>‎kemudian berasa seronok
‎apabila orang beri perhatian.</i>

66
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:08,224
<i>‎"Nampak? Semuanya okey.</i>

67
00:05:08,808 --> 00:05:11,227
<i>‎Inilah tindakan yang betul."
‎Begitulah sangkaan aku.</i>

68
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:14,272
<i>‎Tapi realitinya…</i>

69
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:16,274
‎Awak tahu, Minato?

70
00:05:17,066 --> 00:05:19,777
‎Awak langsung tak kenal diri sendiri.

71
00:05:20,862 --> 00:05:22,613
<i>‎Aku ibarat manusia tanpa jiwa</i>

72
00:05:23,406 --> 00:05:25,867
<i>‎yang mengisi kekosongan dengan orang lain.</i>

73
00:05:27,869 --> 00:05:28,870
<i>‎Aku</i>

74
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:30,913
<i>‎memang bermasalah.</i>

75
00:05:32,874 --> 00:05:34,625
‎MAAF, MOMOKA
‎SAYA NAK BINCANG SESUATU

76
00:05:34,709 --> 00:05:36,294
<i>‎Dia nak "berbincang".</i>

77
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:38,963
<i>‎Sebaik saja dia mengatakannya,</i>

78
00:05:39,714 --> 00:05:42,050
<i>‎aku dah tahu apa dia nak "bincangkan".</i>

79
00:05:42,717 --> 00:05:46,763
<i>‎Sejak kami mula bercinta,
‎hati aku semakin tak tenteram.</i>

80
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:52,268
<i>‎Sudahlah. Aku nak berhenti dulu hari ini.</i>

81
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:57,106
<i>‎Bukannya dia sedar pun
‎betapa aku dah cuba sedaya upaya.</i>

82
00:05:58,316 --> 00:06:02,361
<i>‎Dulu aku selalu cuba buat yang terbaik,
‎tapi sekarang aku dah tak larat.</i>

83
00:06:02,862 --> 00:06:05,323
<i>‎Apabila usaha tak dihargai,
‎aku mula rasa rendah diri.</i>

84
00:06:06,282 --> 00:06:11,579
<i>‎Aku tetap dengan pendirian aku sebab
‎tak nak jadi macam gadis yang aku benci,</i>

85
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:17,293
<i>‎tapi sekarang aku rasa macam
‎dah jadi orang yang aku tak suka.</i>

86
00:06:19,420 --> 00:06:20,463
<i>‎Aku</i>

87
00:06:21,089 --> 00:06:22,381
<i>‎dah bosan dengan semuanya.</i>

88
00:06:35,728 --> 00:06:36,896
‎Kita patut berpisah.

89
00:06:38,481 --> 00:06:40,858
<i>‎Ya. Aku dah agak.</i>

90
00:06:41,734 --> 00:06:44,904
‎Awak nak berpisah dengan saya
‎sebab nak kejar gadis yang awak suka?

91
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,281
‎Tidak.

92
00:06:47,907 --> 00:06:49,242
‎Bukan itu sebabnya.

93
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:52,078
‎Bukan salah awak.

94
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:55,039
‎Tapi salah saya sendiri.

95
00:06:57,208 --> 00:07:00,795
‎Saya tak boleh mengubahnya,
‎walaupun kita terus bercinta.

96
00:07:01,712 --> 00:07:04,090
‎Saya tak boleh jadi orang yang awak mahu.

97
00:07:06,217 --> 00:07:08,052
<i>‎Rasanya aku suka dia.</i>

98
00:07:08,719 --> 00:07:11,055
<i>‎Aku nak dia rasa gembira.</i>

99
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:13,266
<i>‎Tapi…</i>

100
00:07:13,891 --> 00:07:17,603
<i>‎Aku rasa tak semestinya
‎aku yang kena buat dia gembira.</i>

101
00:07:19,147 --> 00:07:21,274
<i>‎Aku tak nak "buat" dia gembira.</i>

102
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,317
<i>‎Aku nak dia "jadi" gembira.</i>

103
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:25,945
‎Saya tak rasa

104
00:07:27,155 --> 00:07:28,489
‎perasaan ini cinta sebenar.

105
00:07:29,824 --> 00:07:30,825
‎Saya minta maaf.

106
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:36,622
‎Saya…

107
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,750
‎Saya dah tahu awak rasa begini.

108
00:07:39,834 --> 00:07:40,835
‎Bodohnya!

109
00:07:40,918 --> 00:07:45,089
‎Saya tahu awak tak suka saya.
‎Tapi awak rasa bertanggungjawab.

110
00:07:45,173 --> 00:07:46,966
‎Saya dah lama tahu.

111
00:07:47,049 --> 00:07:49,594
‎Awak tak tahu betapa sukarnya untuk saya!

112
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:53,598
‎Saya minta maaf.

113
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:55,475
‎Kalau saya cakap lebih awal…

114
00:07:55,558 --> 00:07:57,977
‎Jangan berani cakap
‎awak harap kita tak bercinta.

115
00:08:00,146 --> 00:08:03,316
‎Janganlah tolak semuanya.

116
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:11,449
‎Saya lebih suka awak beritahu saya
‎yang awak suka orang lain.

117
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:14,952
‎Tapi apabila awak cakap
‎"Bukan salah awak, salah saya,"

118
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,623
‎dan buat keputusan sendiri
‎tanpa berbincang dengan saya dulu,

119
00:08:18,706 --> 00:08:22,752
‎seolah-olah awak tak percaya
‎saya boleh bantu awak atasi masalah itu.

120
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:26,506
‎Seolah-olah awak tak sudi
‎berkongsi isi hati dengan saya.

121
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:29,592
{\an8}‎Ikut suka awaklah.

122
00:08:30,426 --> 00:08:33,137
<i>‎Aku dah penat memikirkan semua ini.</i>

123
00:08:34,388 --> 00:08:35,932
<i>‎Teruskan begitu.</i>

124
00:08:36,474 --> 00:08:38,518
<i>‎Kunci sajalah hati kau. Aku tak kisah pun.</i>

125
00:08:44,857 --> 00:08:45,942
‎PANG

126
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:48,819
‎Baiklah. Saya faham.

127
00:08:49,946 --> 00:08:50,947
‎Sampai di sini saja.

128
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:53,574
‎Bodohnya.

129
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:04,627
<i>‎Dah berakhir.</i>

130
00:09:06,462 --> 00:09:09,382
<i>‎Dah berakhir. Tamat juga semua ini.</i>

131
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:12,718
<i>‎Tipulah kalau aku tak sedih,</i>

132
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:17,974
<i>‎tapi aku juga rasa lega
‎sebab dah tak perlu terlalu memikirkannya.</i>

133
00:09:18,849 --> 00:09:20,810
<i>‎Ya. Aku akan okey.</i>

134
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:22,478
<i>‎Lega rasanya ia dah berakhir.</i>

135
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:24,230
<i>‎Aku anggap begitu saja.</i>

136
00:09:27,775 --> 00:09:29,735
‎Aku akan padamkan semua gambar.

137
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:39,287
<i>‎Kami mula bercinta
‎semasa cuti musim panas,</i>

138
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:42,039
<i>‎jadi kami sering berjumpa
‎dan ambil banyak gambar.</i>

139
00:09:45,501 --> 00:09:47,378
<i>‎Dia memang kacak orangnya.</i>

140
00:09:47,461 --> 00:09:50,464
{\an8}<i>‎Tidak. Jangan mudah terpesona!</i>

141
00:09:52,925 --> 00:09:57,763
{\an8}<i>‎Dia ingat aku pernah cakap
‎aku nak tonton filem ini</i>

142
00:09:58,556 --> 00:10:00,641
{\an8}<i>‎dan betapa aku ingin pergi ke tempat ini.</i>

143
00:10:03,477 --> 00:10:07,898
<i>‎Dia juga berjaga lewat malam
‎sebab aku nak berbual di telefon.</i>

144
00:10:08,774 --> 00:10:11,736
<i>‎Kami sangat seronok bersama.</i>

145
00:10:13,362 --> 00:10:14,655
‎Minato.

146
00:10:15,489 --> 00:10:16,907
‎Awak suka saya?

147
00:10:17,491 --> 00:10:18,951
{\an8}‎Ya. Saya suka awak.

148
00:10:19,035 --> 00:10:20,077
{\an8}‎Apa yang awak suka?

149
00:10:20,161 --> 00:10:23,831
{\an8}‎Saya suka sikap awak yang yakin,
‎berani dan cerdik.

150
00:10:23,914 --> 00:10:27,418
{\an8}‎Itu macam pujian yang menyindir, bukan?

151
00:10:28,836 --> 00:10:30,296
‎Tapi tak salah kalau berjaga-jaga.

152
00:10:31,964 --> 00:10:35,551
<i>‎Aku memang benci dilayan
‎macam anak patung.</i>

153
00:10:36,886 --> 00:10:38,721
<i>‎Aku benci dilayan macam aksesori</i>

154
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:43,142
<i>‎dan orang menilai aku
‎hanya berdasarkan penampilan.</i>

155
00:10:43,225 --> 00:10:44,560
‎AWAK PASTI SUKA INI, MOMOKA

156
00:10:44,644 --> 00:10:45,686
‎WAH, SAYA SUKA! HORE!

157
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:46,771
<i>‎Tapi dia…</i>

158
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:49,357
<i>‎Dia melihat diri aku yang sebenar.</i>

159
00:10:49,982 --> 00:10:51,651
<i>‎Dia cuba untuk mengenali aku.</i>

160
00:10:52,818 --> 00:10:54,195
<i>‎Tapi biarpun selepas semua itu…</i>

161
00:10:55,988 --> 00:10:57,406
<i>‎dia masih tak pilih aku</i>

162
00:10:59,659 --> 00:11:04,205
<i>‎Kenapa baru sekarang aku sedar
‎semua kebaikan selepas semuanya berakhir?</i>

163
00:11:05,122 --> 00:11:09,335
<i>‎Kenapa aku tak sedar
‎betapa baiknya dia semasa kami bercinta?</i>

164
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:14,924
<i>‎Daripada memikirkan kekurangan
‎dan buat diri sendiri gelisah,</i>

165
00:11:15,591 --> 00:11:19,595
<i>‎aku patut bersyukur atas perhatian
‎dan kebaikan yang dia tunjukkan.</i>

166
00:11:19,678 --> 00:11:22,098
<i>‎Kalau asyik mementingkan diri sendiri,</i>

167
00:11:23,015 --> 00:11:25,101
‎kita cuma akan nampak kekurangan diri.

168
00:11:26,227 --> 00:11:28,854
‎Kesudahannya,
‎kita sendiri yang akan merana.

169
00:11:31,690 --> 00:11:35,111
‎GERAMNYA

170
00:11:38,739 --> 00:11:39,782
‎Tak mungkin.

171
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:42,910
‎Saya ingatkan mereka kata
‎Amamiya yang selalu ditinggalkan?

172
00:11:42,993 --> 00:11:44,370
‎Mungkin dia memang curang?

173
00:11:44,453 --> 00:11:46,372
‎Dengan gadis di tangga itu?

174
00:11:46,455 --> 00:11:47,873
‎Teruk betul.

175
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:50,459
‎Momoka.

176
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:53,921
‎Bangunlah. Jom balik.

177
00:11:54,004 --> 00:11:55,381
‎Jangan begini, cerialah sikit.

178
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:57,591
‎Nak beli makanan enak
‎dalam perjalanan balik?

179
00:11:57,675 --> 00:11:59,135
‎Hari ini kita makan apa saja.

180
00:11:59,218 --> 00:12:01,887
‎Ceritalah. Luahkan semuanya.

181
00:12:03,931 --> 00:12:05,141
‎Terima kasih.

182
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:06,642
‎BAM

183
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:10,020
‎Bukan ini yang saya bayangkan.

184
00:12:10,104 --> 00:12:11,897
‎JOM MAKAN UNTUK HILANGKAN DUKA - HEHE

185
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:13,899
‎Kamu tahu?

186
00:12:14,608 --> 00:12:18,279
‎Saya akan pastikan saya lebih sayangi diri
‎dalam hubungan seterusnya.

187
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,740
‎Saya akan mencintai diri sendiri

188
00:12:22,450 --> 00:12:26,412
‎dan mencari orang yang cintakan saya
‎sama macam saya cintakan dia.

189
00:12:29,707 --> 00:12:33,127
‎Kalau saya rasa dia menjauhkan diri,
‎saya akan terus tinggalkan dia.

190
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,921
‎Kalau dia tinggalkan saya, biarlah,

191
00:12:36,005 --> 00:12:38,424
‎sebab saya tahu dia tak ada cita rasa.

192
00:12:39,425 --> 00:12:42,428
‎Saya akan jadi gadis seperti itu.

193
00:12:45,681 --> 00:12:46,932
‎- Bagus.
‎- Bagus.

194
00:12:47,016 --> 00:12:48,017
‎YA!

195
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,394
‎Baguslah! Macam itulah!

196
00:12:51,479 --> 00:12:53,564
‎Pedasnya.

197
00:12:53,647 --> 00:12:56,567
‎Tapi sedap sangat.

198
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:57,860
‎Awak boleh!

199
00:12:57,943 --> 00:12:58,944
‎GYOSHO CINA MEMBARA

200
00:13:00,654 --> 00:13:03,365
<i>‎Amamiya dan Momoka berpisah.</i>

201
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:04,450
‎GRED 2 KELAS 2

202
00:13:04,533 --> 00:13:05,868
<i>‎Tiba-tiba saja.</i>

203
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:10,122
<i>‎Sepatutnya aku akan rasa gembira, tapi…</i>

204
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:15,127
‎Aduhai, tengoklah dia.
‎Nak bergurau pun tak boleh.

205
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:18,380
‎Dia nampak sangat murung sejak semalam.

206
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:20,758
‎Hino! Buatlah sesuatu!

207
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,093
‎Saya tak boleh buat apa-apa.

208
00:13:24,261 --> 00:13:25,262
<i>‎Sebelum ini…</i>

209
00:13:25,930 --> 00:13:31,227
‎Saya bersyukur mereka suka saya,
‎walaupun sekejap saja.

210
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:35,940
<i>‎Dia nampak selamba saja selepas berpisah.</i>

211
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,109
<i>‎Aku sangka dia memang begitu, tapi…</i>

212
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:42,363
‎MENGINTAI

213
00:13:49,537 --> 00:13:52,373
‎Amamiya. Awak rasa lebih baik hari ini?

214
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:55,793
‎KELETIHAN

215
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:58,921
{\an8}‎Ya. Saya dah okey.

216
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:00,714
{\an8}‎Terima kasih.

217
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:04,093
‎Ya? Baguslah.

218
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:08,597
‎Koyun!

219
00:14:08,681 --> 00:14:12,893
‎Hei! Susahnya!
‎Dia betul-betul nampak berbeza.

220
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:13,978
<i>‎Kami baru berpisah.</i>

221
00:14:14,562 --> 00:14:15,646
{\an8}‎Midorikawa dah cakap.

222
00:14:15,729 --> 00:14:16,730
{\an8}‎TAK BOLEH GURAU DENGAN DIA

223
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:19,567
‎Jauhkan diri daripada Minato.

224
00:14:20,484 --> 00:14:23,612
<i>‎Susah nak percaya
‎Momoka yang mulakan semua ini.</i>

225
00:14:24,905 --> 00:14:26,198
<i>‎Jadi, Amamiya mulakan?</i>

226
00:14:27,408 --> 00:14:28,701
<i>‎Kalau begitu…</i>

227
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:31,871
‎Koyuki. Ini peluang awak.

228
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:32,955
‎Tsukko!

229
00:14:33,038 --> 00:14:38,252
{\an8}‎Fikirlah. Isi kekosongan hatinya
‎semasa dia bersedih, kemudian…

230
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:40,462
{\an8}‎Ya! Buat begitu, Koyun.

231
00:14:47,011 --> 00:14:51,348
<i>‎Mengisi kekosongan hatinya
‎mungkin tindakan yang betul</i>

232
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,225
<i>‎jika dia bersedih sebab putus hubungan.</i>

233
00:14:55,311 --> 00:14:57,563
‎Awak ada dengar?
‎Koyuki tinggalkan Igarashi.

234
00:14:57,646 --> 00:15:00,316
‎Betulkah? Mereka bukan
‎sedang asyik bercinta?

235
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:05,070
<i>‎Tapi kalau dia rasa bersalah
‎atau asyik menyalahkan diri sendiri,</i>

236
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:10,576
<i>‎apa lagi aku boleh buat untuk bantu dia?</i>

237
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:15,331
{\an8}‎Awak dah putus dengan Kuriki?

238
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:16,582
‎Ya.

239
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:19,835
‎Boleh saya cuba pikat dia?

240
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:22,254
‎Awak ada prinsip atau tak?

241
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:23,589
‎Tak, bukan begitu.

242
00:15:24,590 --> 00:15:27,468
‎Saya tak layak
‎beritahu apa awak patut buat.

243
00:15:27,551 --> 00:15:30,888
‎Saya tahu awak pasti
‎dapat pengganti tak lama lagi.

244
00:15:30,971 --> 00:15:31,972
‎AHAHA

245
00:15:38,604 --> 00:15:40,272
‎Azumi!

246
00:15:42,191 --> 00:15:43,525
‎Akahoshi?

247
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:44,944
‎Macam mana keadaan Amamiya?

248
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:48,030
‎Ya. Masih sedih sebab berpisah.

249
00:15:48,113 --> 00:15:49,114
‎Perpisahan itu, ya?

250
00:15:49,198 --> 00:15:52,368
{\an8}‎Hari jadinya hujung minggu ini.

251
00:15:54,453 --> 00:15:55,829
{\an8}‎Apa?

252
00:15:55,913 --> 00:15:57,247
{\an8}‎Saya faham.

253
00:15:57,748 --> 00:15:59,124
{\an8}‎Kasihan, Amamiya.

254
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:02,211
‎Memandangkan hari jadinya akan tiba,
‎saya terfikir nak buat ini,

255
00:16:02,294 --> 00:16:04,380
‎tapi saya kurang arif tentang hal begini.

256
00:16:04,463 --> 00:16:07,132
{\an8}‎Wah. Bagusnya idea itu!

257
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:09,885
‎- Dia mesti suka.
‎- Betul?

258
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:12,721
‎Kalau nak buat begini,
‎biar kelakar sikit, okey?

259
00:16:12,805 --> 00:16:14,682
‎- Betul.
‎- Kamu buat apa?

260
00:16:14,765 --> 00:16:15,766
‎CAK
‎MIDORIKAWA MUNCUL TIBA-TIBA!

261
00:16:17,685 --> 00:16:18,894
‎Jadi…

262
00:16:19,853 --> 00:16:21,146
‎SAMBUTAN HARI JADI MINATO

263
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:22,815
‎Kejutan sambutan hari jadi!

264
00:16:23,857 --> 00:16:26,735
‎Jom beli barang yang boleh digunakan.

265
00:16:26,819 --> 00:16:28,028
‎- Ya!
‎- Ya!

266
00:16:28,112 --> 00:16:29,947
‎Nak beli untuk Minato?

267
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,490
‎- Ini pula?
‎- Tak perlu.

268
00:16:31,573 --> 00:16:34,034
‎HAHAHA

269
00:16:35,411 --> 00:16:37,538
‎Kamu ada aktiviti kelab hari ini, bukan?

270
00:16:37,621 --> 00:16:41,000
‎Pesta kebudayaan dah selesai,
‎jadi kami tak buat apa-apa sangat.

271
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:44,336
‎Kelab pancaragam pun
‎cuma buat hal sendiri.

272
00:16:49,216 --> 00:16:50,843
‎Yota dah selesai aktiviti kelab.

273
00:16:50,926 --> 00:16:51,927
‎Nak saya jemput dia?

274
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,181
<i>‎Terkejutnya.</i>

275
00:16:56,807 --> 00:17:00,561
<i>‎Tapi takkanlah saya perlu rasa kekok
‎setiap kali bersama dia?</i>

276
00:17:01,145 --> 00:17:03,564
<i>‎Lagipun, dia dah lupakannya.</i>

277
00:17:03,647 --> 00:17:05,065
<i>‎Ia dah berlalu.</i>

278
00:17:05,149 --> 00:17:08,819
{\an8}<i>‎Malah, tak eloklah
‎kalau asyik ungkit hal itu.</i>

279
00:17:12,781 --> 00:17:14,199
‎BAM

280
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,368
<i>‎Aku rasa…</i>

281
00:17:16,452 --> 00:17:17,453
‎DUP DAP DUP DAP
‎SEDUT

282
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:22,833
{\an8}<i>‎Yota asyik fikir cara
‎untuk buat awak gembira.</i>

283
00:17:23,459 --> 00:17:26,462
<i>‎Dia tak mengharapkan
‎awak buat dia gembira.</i>

284
00:17:27,212 --> 00:17:30,257
{\an8}‎Bagi saya, awak tetap Miki.

285
00:17:32,843 --> 00:17:35,345
<i>‎Hentikan! Jangan fikir itu sekarang!</i>

286
00:17:35,429 --> 00:17:37,389
‎Awak memang makan banyak, Yota.

287
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:41,560
‎Okey, kami ikut jalan ini.

288
00:17:43,353 --> 00:17:44,980
‎Ya?

289
00:17:45,064 --> 00:17:47,983
‎- Jumpa lagi!
‎- Jumpa esok!

290
00:17:49,777 --> 00:17:52,071
‎Dah nak balik?
‎Jom jalan sama-sama sekejap.

291
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:53,655
‎Ya…

292
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:05,250
<i>‎Wah, kami berdua saja.</i>

293
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,502
<i>‎Wah…</i>

294
00:18:07,377 --> 00:18:09,254
<i>‎Apa aku patut buat?</i>

295
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:13,133
<i>‎Aku tak suka ini.
‎Aku tak suka perasaan ini.</i>

296
00:18:13,967 --> 00:18:16,470
<i>‎Rasa macam aku yang kekok.</i>

297
00:18:17,096 --> 00:18:19,014
<i>‎Rasa macam aku tak boleh buat biasa.</i>

298
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:23,894
<i>‎Aku okey saja sebelum ini.</i>

299
00:18:31,068 --> 00:18:33,112
‎- Itu kucing?
‎- Mana?

300
00:18:33,195 --> 00:18:35,405
‎Saya yakin ada nampak haiwan tadi.

301
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,449
‎Jom pergi cari?

302
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:40,327
‎Apa agaknya? Wah, seronoknya.

303
00:18:40,410 --> 00:18:42,037
‎Kalau itu <i>‎tsuchinoko</i>‎?

304
00:18:44,832 --> 00:18:46,125
‎Lihat! Di situ.

305
00:18:47,292 --> 00:18:49,169
‎MERENUNG…

306
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:51,672
‎Perlukah awak fokus sangat?

307
00:18:51,755 --> 00:18:52,923
‎MENGHENDAP

308
00:18:53,006 --> 00:18:54,174
‎Sedia dan…

309
00:18:54,258 --> 00:18:55,551
‎WHUS

310
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:58,387
‎MELAYANG-LAYANG

311
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:00,055
‎*RUMPUT BERGULUNG

312
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:04,143
{\an8}‎Apa itu?

313
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:10,691
{\an8}‎Tak, sekejap…

314
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:13,235
‎Saya betul-betul nampak ia bergerak.

315
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,444
‎Ini?

316
00:19:14,528 --> 00:19:15,529
‎MELAYANG-LAYANG

317
00:19:17,781 --> 00:19:19,199
‎Apa sebenarnya ini?

318
00:19:19,283 --> 00:19:20,576
‎Jangan tanya saya!

319
00:19:20,659 --> 00:19:23,203
<i>‎Saya ingatkan ini cuma ada di Barat.</i>

320
00:19:24,163 --> 00:19:25,164
‎SUDAH SUDAH

321
00:19:25,247 --> 00:19:27,583
‎Saya mula suka benda ini. Dah, si kecil.

322
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:37,593
<i>‎Aku dah agak.</i>

323
00:19:39,428 --> 00:19:41,305
<i>‎Aku suka habiskan masa dengan Yota.</i>

324
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:45,726
<i>‎Aku suka diri aku apabila bersamanya.</i>

325
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:49,271
<i>‎Aku suka Yota.</i>

326
00:19:51,356 --> 00:19:53,692
<i>‎Bukan hanya sebagai pasangan atau kawan.</i>

327
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:55,819
<i>‎Aku suka dirinya.</i>

328
00:19:57,404 --> 00:19:59,281
<i>‎Semudah itu.</i>

329
00:20:00,073 --> 00:20:02,367
<i>‎Beginilah sepatutnya sejak awal lagi.</i>

330
00:20:02,993 --> 00:20:06,705
<i>‎Jadi, kenapa sekarang
‎aku asyik fikir yang bukan-bukan?</i>

331
00:20:08,457 --> 00:20:10,792
‎Kelakar juga tadi.

332
00:20:10,876 --> 00:20:11,877
‎Dah nak balik?

333
00:20:13,587 --> 00:20:15,130
‎Babai, Pokojiro.

334
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:16,381
‎Adik Pokota?

335
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:20,552
‎Satu, dua, satu, dua…

336
00:20:20,636 --> 00:20:22,304
‎Wah, susah betul nak naik semula.

337
00:20:22,387 --> 00:20:23,388
‎Ya.

338
00:20:27,935 --> 00:20:28,936
‎Dapat pun.

339
00:20:30,938 --> 00:20:33,106
‎Awak tak apa-apa? Hati-hati.

340
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:34,358
‎Ya…

341
00:20:34,983 --> 00:20:36,360
‎Terima kasih.

342
00:20:41,865 --> 00:20:42,866
‎Sedia…

343
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,368
‎Lompat!

344
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:47,454
‎Saya tak bersedia.

345
00:20:47,537 --> 00:20:48,997
‎Bertenang.

346
00:20:49,581 --> 00:20:52,000
<i>‎Jangan fikirkan sangat.</i>

347
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,752
<i>‎Jangan rumitkan keadaan.</i>

348
00:21:00,842 --> 00:21:02,511
{\an8}<i>‎- Angin itu…</i>
‎- Hei.

349
00:21:03,178 --> 00:21:04,596
‎Nyamannya angin ini.

350
00:21:07,224 --> 00:21:08,558
‎Musim luruh akan tiba.

351
00:21:09,768 --> 00:21:11,353
‎Seronok pula rasanya, ya?

352
00:21:11,895 --> 00:21:13,063
‎Tapi detik seperti ini,

353
00:21:13,146 --> 00:21:16,441
‎apabila cuaca sejuk
‎dan kita rasa perubahan musim,

354
00:21:16,525 --> 00:21:18,777
‎inilah detik yang buat
‎saya rasa sangat teruja.

355
00:21:21,613 --> 00:21:22,614
<i>‎Alamak…</i>

356
00:21:24,491 --> 00:21:26,994
<i>‎Aku dah tak boleh nafikannya.</i>

357
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:31,790
<i>‎Tunggu, tak mungkin. Apa?</i>

358
00:21:31,873 --> 00:21:34,126
<i>‎Tidak. Mustahil.</i>

359
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,088
‎Jumpa esok.

360
00:22:00,068 --> 00:22:03,405
<i>‎Aku masih tersenyum
‎teringatkan keseronokan tadi.</i>

361
00:22:04,948 --> 00:22:10,746
<i>‎Langkahku terasa ringan, seakan melayang
‎kerana rasa teruja dan gementar.</i>

362
00:22:11,705 --> 00:22:14,374
<i>‎Namun, hati aku terasa sebak.</i>

363
00:22:14,958 --> 00:22:16,251
<i>‎Seolah-olah mahu menangis.</i>

364
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,421
<i>‎Apa aku nak buat?</i>

365
00:22:20,422 --> 00:22:22,883
<i>‎Inilah cinta. Mudah dan jelas.</i>

366
00:23:50,929 --> 00:23:55,934
{\an8}‎Terjemahan sari kata oleh Bibi Ellyvine

